{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":74738076,"ns":0,"title":"Carré du champ operator","extract":"The carré du champ operator (French for square of a field operator) is a bilinear, symmetric operator from analysis and probability theory. The carré du champ operator measures how far an infinitesimal generator is from being a derivation.","description":"Operator in analysis and probability theory","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}